    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d465">

                <pb facs="1023" n="927" sameAs="frus:frus1879/pg927"/>

                <head>No. 434.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hoffman to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1879-11-04"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 4,
                        1879</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 152.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my No. 150, I have the honor
                    to inclose to you herewith a copy of a note I yesterday addressed to Baron
                    Jomini in the case of Mr. Calvocoressi. In accordance with your instructions, I
                    have endeavored to present his case briefly, and as a claim in equity rather
                    than in law.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>WICKHAM HOFFMAN.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d465-a1.xml" xpointer="d465-a1"/>
            </div>
